Recursion & Backtracking — Complete Deep Dive
 
For Google DeepMind L5, 
I want you to think about these as problem-solving frameworks, 
not just coding techniques.

The mental progression is:

                          Recursion
                             ↓
                          Recursion Tree
                             ↓
                          Multiple Choices
                             ↓
